    "AGENTS.md": "<!-- surveyjs:start -->\n## SurveyJS\n\nInstalled in this project: `survey-core@3.0.1`, `survey-js-ui@3.0.1`. UI framework: **vanilla**.\n\nThe SurveyJS agent skills are installed in `.agents/skills`. Read the skill that matches the task before writing or changing SurveyJS code — they carry the current v3 API and the mistakes to check generated code against:\n\n- [`surveyjs-brand-styling`](.agents/skills/surveyjs-brand-styling/SKILL.md) — Style a SurveyJS application so it matches a custom app design, design system, or brandbook\n- [`surveyjs-form-json`](.agents/skills/surveyjs-form-json/SKILL.md) — Author, edit, or debug SurveyJS survey/form JSON\n- [`surveyjs-integration`](.agents/skills/surveyjs-integration/SKILL.md) — Integrate the SurveyJS Form Library into React, Next.js, Angular, Vue, vanilla JS, or jQuery apps\n\nEverything between the `surveyjs:start` and `surveyjs:end` markers is regenerated by `surveyjs-cli 0.1.0` (`npx surveyjs-cli@latest init-agents`). Put your own notes outside the markers.\n<!-- surveyjs:end -->\n"
